Upstream sources
----------------

1. Particle Data Group (PDG) — particle properties via the PDG REST API
   https://pdg.lbl.gov / https://pdgapi.lbl.gov
   Review of Particle Physics; citation policy per PDG terms of use.

2. CODATA fundamental physical constants, redistributed via SciPy
   https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/constants.html
   SciPy is BSD-3-Clause; CODATA values are public reference data.

3. Basis Set Exchange (BSE) — STO-3G Gaussian basis sets
   https://www.basissetexchange.org
   W. T. Borremans et al. / Feller group; attribution per BSE terms.

4. IAEA LiveChart / AME atomic mass evaluation
   https://www-nds.iaea.org/livechart
   IAEA data terms apply.

